{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12417","headline":"送张员外出牧岳州 · 钱起","name":"送张员外出牧岳州","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"凤凰衔诏与何人，善政多才宠寇恂。\n台上鸳鸾争送远，岳阳云树待行春。\n自怜黄阁知音在，不厌彤幨出守频。\n应笑冯唐衰且拙，世情相见白头新。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"钱起","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_12417.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12417","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}